EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Dear {!Contact.Name},
As part of {!Contact.Account}'s pre-employment screening and background checking procedures, your consent is required to authorise Credit Bureau (Singapore) Pte Ltd ("CBS") to provide your consumer credit report(s) and/or credit information to {!Contact.Account}.
Upon submission of your consent, it shall remain valid for a period of one (1) month from the submission date, unless withdrawn earlier. You will receive notification(s) for any credit information request(s) made by {!Contact.Account} to CBS during the consent validity period. To complete this process, please access the secure link below to submit the required documents, personal information and consent:
[CONSENT LINK] {!Consent_Request_Item__c.Email_Authorize_Url__c}
If you do not wish to provide consent, you may decline by using the link below: [DECLINE LINK] {!Consent_Request_Item__c.Email_Decline_Url__c}
If you had already provided consent previously, you may withdraw your consent at any time by accessing the withdrawal link below and completing the required identity verification steps: [WITHDRAWAL LINK] {!Consent_Request_Item__c.Email_Withdraw_Url__c}
Note: {!Contact.Account} will be notified of your consent status if you choose to decline or withdraw your consent from CBS. As a result, {!Contact.Account} will not be able to request for your credit information from CBS unless valid consent has been provided.
If you are unsure of this email, you may contact [NAME OF BANK AND DEPARTMENT] at {!Contact.Account}.
Thank you.
[NAME OF BANK AND DEPARTMENT]
